# For the root Dockerfile, built from the repo root. Only the two app folders
# go into the build context; everything else (docs, the vision backend, git
# data) stays out. The app folders' own .dockerignore files apply to the
# compose builds, which use those folders as their context.
*
!Hack B Pool API
!Hack B Pool Client

# Local environments, build output, caches and secrets inside those folders.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/*.local

# The local database must never be baked into an image.
**/pool.sqlite3*

# Tests are not needed at run time.
**/test_*.py
**/*.test.js
